		(at 116.72 83.49)
		(descr "Through hole straight pin header, 1x14, 2.54mm pitch, single row -- MARV V2 copy for the J6/J7/J8 IO block on the right board edge. The courtyard is trimmed to the plastic body across the row (+-1.27 mm, no side margin) so the three columns GND | POWER | SIGNAL abut exactly on the 2.54 mm grid, and the silkscreen outline is dropped because the per-row label band needs that space; the board draws the end ticks, the pin-1 mark and every label instead. Pads, drills, fabrication layer and 3D model are unchanged.")
